Uncertainty, discrepancy and the scope of a thermal claim (@th-uncertainty: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer, #source "../sources/Guarded-Hot-Plate-and-SRM-1450e-NIST.lingua#r_1PP28H0Y6N7RVY89W9HSQY18E4", #source "../sources/Time-Domain-Thermoreflectance-Jiang-Qian-Yang.lingua#r_7ZHR7DG99WYCCG8J21HTKE9TMS", #source "../sources/IAPWS-95-Fundamental-Water-Formulation.lingua#r_4JH7YVKGMCC4R7MK1F5S1XY90Z", #thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer "Design-an-experiment-to-separate-thermal-mechanisms.lingua#r_00AM5RFVW5P8HMGF76ZR2TDH1A") { r_0CQRV60W4KYW8JS1G7F5MYHA3J
**Read:** [Guarded-hot-plate evidence — NIST SP 260-201](../sources/Guarded-Hot-Plate-and-SRM-1450e-NIST.lingua#r_1PP28H0Y6N7RVY89W9HSQY18E4), the complete uncertainty account; [Time-domain thermoreflectance — Jiang, Qian and Yang](../sources/Time-Domain-Thermoreflectance-Jiang-Qian-Yang.lingua#r_7ZHR7DG99WYCCG8J21HTKE9TMS), parameter sensitivity and independent-property uncertainty; [IAPWS-95 — fundamental water properties](../sources/IAPWS-95-Fundamental-Water-Formulation.lingua#r_4JH7YVKGMCC4R7MK1F5S1XY90Z), formulation validity and uncertainty distinctions.

Separate numerical error, uncertain inputs, parameter estimation, material variability and model discrepancy. A refined mesh addresses discretization; it does not correct an omitted contact resistance or an inappropriate radiation boundary. An accurately known sensor calibration does not establish its installation error.

Propagate coupled input uncertainties through the actual measurement or design equation, retaining correlations. Compare linear sensitivities with a nonlinear calculation near phase boundaries, small temperature differences or strongly temperature-dependent radiation. Declare the reference state and validity range of every property model.

Use independent observations to challenge the physical assumptions. State a claim with its operating domain and unresolved alternatives: for example, predicted peak temperature under a bounded load and cooling condition. Report extrapolation openly. A narrow agreement at one condition is weaker evidence than prediction across deliberately changed conditions that probe competing mechanisms.

